{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"diagnosis\":\"The theorem body was only `skip`; the diamond proof requires induction on the first parallel reduction and analysis of the second, with the irreducibility lemmas resolving overlaps between application-parallelism and primitive I/K/S reductions.\",\"proof_body\":\"by\\n  intro a a₁ a₂ h₁ h₂\\n  revert a₂\\n  induction h₁ with\\n  | @refl x =>\\n      intro a₂ h₂\\n      exact ⟨a₂, h₂, .refl a₂⟩\\n  | @red_I x =>\\n      intro a₂ h₂\\n      cases h₂ with\\n      | refl =>\\n          exact ⟨x, .refl x, .red_I x⟩\\n      | red_I =>\\n          exact ⟨x, .refl x, .refl x⟩\\n      | @par l l' r r' hl hr =>\\n          have hl' : l' = I := I_irreducible l' hl\\n          subst l'\\n          exact ⟨r', hr, .red_I r'⟩\\n  | @red_K x y =>\\n      intro a₂ h₂\\n      cases h₂ with\\n      | refl =>\\n          exact ⟨x, .refl x, .red_K x y⟩\\n      | red_K =>\\n          exact ⟨x, .refl x, .refl x⟩\\n      | @par l l' r r' hl hr =>\\n          obtain ⟨x', hx, hl'⟩ := Ka_irreducible x l' hl\\n          subst l'\\n          exact ⟨x', hx, .red_K x' r'⟩\\n  | @red_S x y z =>\\n      intro a₂ h₂\\n      cases h₂ with\\n      | refl =>\\n          exact ⟨x ⬝ z ⬝ (y ⬝ z), .refl _, .red_S x y z⟩\\n      | red_S =>\\n          exact ⟨x ⬝ z ⬝ (y ⬝ z), .refl _, .refl _⟩\\n      | @par l l' r r' hl hr =>\\n          obtain ⟨x', y', hx, hy, hl'⟩ := Sab_irreducible x y l' hl\\n          subst l'\\n          exact\\n            ⟨x' ⬝ r' ⬝ (y' ⬝ r'),\\n              .par (.par hx hr) (.par hy hr),\\n              .red_S x' y' r'⟩\\n  | @par x x' y y' hx hy ihx ihy =>\\n      intro a₂ h₂\\n      cases h₂ with\\n      | refl =>\\n          exact ⟨x' ⬝ y', .refl _, .par hx hy⟩\\n      | @red_I z =>\\n          have hx' : x' = I := I_irreducible x' hx\\n          subst x'\\n          exact ⟨y', .red_I y', hy⟩\\n      | @red_K u v =>\\n          obtain ⟨u', hu, hx'⟩ := Ka_irreducible u x' hx\\n          subst x'\\n          exact ⟨u', .red_K u' y', hu⟩\\n      | @red_S u v w =>\\n          obtain ⟨u', v', hu, hv, hx'⟩ := Sab_irreducible u v x' hx\\n          subst x'\\n          exact\\n            ⟨u' ⬝ y' ⬝ (v' ⬝ y'),\\n              .red_S u' v' y',\\n              .par (.par hu hy) (.par hv hy)⟩\\n      | @par u u' v v' hu hv =>\\n          obtain ⟨p, hxp, hup⟩ := ihx u' hu\\n          obtain ⟨q, hyq, hvq⟩ := ihy v' hv\\n          exact ⟨p ⬝ q, .par hxp hyq, .par hup hvq⟩\"}"}}
